    "chapter": 4,
    "title": "The Temptation of Jesus",
    "scene": "Immediately after being declared God's beloved Son, Jesus is driven into the wilderness to be tested — a direct echo of Israel's own forty years of testing in the wilderness, except where Israel repeatedly failed, Jesus succeeds.",
